{% import 'components.njk' as components %}

<div class="tools">
  <section>
    <a class="header" href="/tempo-adjust">
      <div class="header__logo-container">
        {{
          components.themedImage("/images/tempo-adjust-logo.png",
          "/images/tempo-adjust-logo-dark.png", "Tempo Adjust logo",
          "header__logo--h3")
        }}
      </div>
      <h3>Tempo Adjust</h3>
    </a>

    <p>
      Browser extensions that let DJs detect and adjust the tempo of tracks on
      Bandcamp and Discogs. Available for
      <a href="/tempo-adjust#install">Chrome and Firefox</a>, with a Safari app
      on the way.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>
      <a href="https://greasyfork.org/en/scripts/522681-hardwax-random-button"
        >Hardwax Random Button</a
      >
    </h3>
    <p>
      A userscript that adds a random button to
      <a href="https://hardwax.com">Hardwax</a>, for when you want to dig but
      don't know where to start.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>
      <a href="/files/automator-actions-for-djs.zip">Quick Actions for DJs</a>
    </h3>
    <p>
      Three macOS Quick Actions for music collectors: get a spectrogram to check
      for fake lossless files, convert to 320kbps MP3, and convert to AIFF, all
      from the Finder right-click menu. The
      <a href="/blog/2025/07/09/dont-get-fooled-by-fake-lossless-files-again/"
        >installation guide</a
      >
      walks through setting them up.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p>
      <small
        >Older, non-software projects live on the
        <a href="/about#past-projects">about page</a>.</small
      >
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
